"""Spring Boot 4.x practice for the Spring Boot AI pack: a request, the correct Spring Boot 4.1.1 code and a JUnit test that proves it. Every task is
compiled and its test run against Spring Boot 4.1.1 by scripts/springboot-verify.py before it is used for training (tasks that fail are dropped).
They teach what changed in Spring Boot 4: test slices in the new modules (org.springframework.boot.webmvc.test.autoconfigure.WebMvcTest),
@MockitoBean instead of the removed @MockBean, RestClient, SecurityFilterChain beans, records for DTOs and @ConfigurationProperties.
Each task: (id, request, {path: code} main files, {path: code} test files). Paths are under com/tulai/check/<id>/."""
import random

